## 语言模型 / Language models

不随安装包分发、不经我们的服务器：程序给出官方下载链接，用户自行下载后放入模型文件夹，程序只加载哈希在白名单（electron/shared/llm-packs.js）里的文件。
Not bundled and not re-hosted: the app links to the official download, the user places the file in the models folder, and only files whose hash is on the whitelist are loaded.

